ed from glycine or by Strecker) provides aminopropanal via NiS catalysis, then sequential cyclization and reduction.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_002", "rxn_003", "rxn_004", "rxn_005"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_009", "mol_013", "mol_017"]}, {"pathway_id": "P8", "name": "Maleic acid chain extension pathway", "description": "Maleic acid condenses with glycine (borate-catalyzed) to GABA, through aminocrotonic acid, cyclizes to proline.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_009", "rxn_007", "rxn_008"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_010", "mol_011"]}, {"pathway_id": "P9", "name": "Propanal-based amination/cyclization", "description": "Propanal undergoes Strecker-type amination to GABA, dehydrated to aminocrotonic acid, cyclized to proline.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_006", "rxn_007", "rxn_008"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_010", "mol_011"]}, {"pathway_id": "P10", "name": "Cyclization with exogenous CO2 (butanal amination)", "description": "Butanal is aminated to 4-aminobutanal, immediately cyclized with CO2 to pyrroline-2-carboxylate, reduced to L-proline.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_010", "rxn_011", "rxn_005"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_014", "mol_017"]}], "hub_molecules": ["mol_008", "mol_009", "mol_010", "mol_017"], "convergence_points": [{"molecule_id": "mol_010", "incoming_reactions": ["rxn_006", "rxn_009"], "outgoing_reactions": ["rxn_007"]}, {"molecule_id": "mol_011", "incoming_reactions": ["rxn_007"], "outgoing_reactions": ["rxn_008"]}, {"molecule_id": "mol_017", "incoming_reactions": ["rxn_004", "rxn_011"], "outgoing_reactions": ["rxn_005"]}]}, "reasoning": "", "duration_ms": 49391.72172546387, "success": true, "error_message": null}
